feat: profile edit, 1:1 chat, post viewer modes, image zoom, v0.1.6

- profile: PATCH /api/me + ProfileEditModal (name + avatar via /api/upload)
- chat: ChatRoom/ChatMessage models, /api/chat/{users,rooms,rooms/[id]/messages}; ChatDock wired to real APIs (search, list, send, pinning, polling)
